{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["To be with her — he was careful even to be secluded with her, until an incident occurred: he remained alone against his will, to do the work of the household needs as was his routine, and it happened on that day that no man was left in the house. And the derash of the Aggadah: that they had gone to see the Nile, the river of Egypt, which had risen over all its banks."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 39, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:46:42.534414349Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}